<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Jobsite Credential Test Email Sent</title>
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:wght@500&family=Poppins&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
        color: #474747;
        width: 100%;
        background-color: #fff;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .content {
        font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
        padding: 20px;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .title {
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 500;
        line-height: 32px;
        color: #474747;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .body-content p {
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .body-content b {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .section-heading {
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #004174;
        margin: 24px 0 8px 0;
      }

      .details-box {
        background-color: #f0f7fc;
        border-left: 4px solid #004174;
        padding: 16px;
        margin: 8px 0 20px 0;
      }

      .details-box p {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .details-box p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      .signature {
        margin-top: 24px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- Header -->
    <div style="background-color: #004174; padding: 28px 32px; text-align: center">
      <img
        src="https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/cvtocareer-394713.appspot.com/o/laigusbucket%2FC2C.png?alt=media&token=2c05d23e-1974-4a83-8143-99c1b6b96801"
        alt="CVtoCAREER Logo"
        style="display: block; margin: 0 auto; width: 149px; height: 32px"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="content">
      <h1 class="title">Jobsite Credential Test Email Sent</h1>

      <div class="body-content">
        <b>Dear Team,</b>

        <p>
          An admin has sent a test email to a client's delegated mailbox to
          confirm forwarding actually works. This does not change the
          credential's status.
        </p>

        <p class="section-heading">📋 Test Details</p>
        <div class="details-box">
          <p><strong>Client:</strong> <%= clientName %></p>
          <p><strong>Application email:</strong> <%= credentialEmail %></p>
          <p><strong>Sent by (admin ID):</strong> <%= adminId %></p>
          <p><strong>Next step:</strong> Confirm the test email arrived, then approve or reject</p>
        </div>

        <div class="signature">
          <p>Best regards,<br />The CVtoCAREER System</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <div
      style="
        padding: 16px 32px;
        background-color: #f9fafb;
        border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        text-align: center;
      "
    >
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af">
        © <%= currentYear %> CVtoCAREER. All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
